{"name":"Survivalist","type":"specialty","_id":"2ZdsSOk3bTAcFNxs","img":"icons/svg/book.svg","system":{"description":"You are a master of adaptation. Your allies appreciate your mile-wide expertise, which leaves you equipped to face nearly any challenge head-on.","size":1,"tierMax":3,"attributes":{"strong":{"value":2,"max":2},"agile":{"value":2,"max":2},"cunning":{"value":2,"max":2},"vigilant":{"value":3,"max":3},"careful":{"value":2,"max":2},"tenacious":{"value":3,"max":3}},"physLimit":6,"menLimit":6,"skills":[{"name":"Wild Nature","tier":1,"skillType":"specialty","uses":0,"description":"You have proficiency 1 in long arms and thrown weapons, and you add your Survivalist TV to both your Physical and Mental Limits."},{"name":"Pack Mule","tier":1,"skillType":"specialty","uses":0,"description":"All non-weapon equipment you carry has its size reduced by 1, to a minimum of 1."},{"name":"Survival Instincts","tier":1,"skillType":"specialty","uses":0,"description":"Add your Survivalist TV to all journey task rolls you make."},{"name":"Animal Handling","tier":2,"skillType":"specialty","uses":0,"description":"Cunning 4. When making a roll to calm an animal, add your Survivalist TV. You can communicate simple ideas to animals you befriend."},{"name":"Lean-To","tier":2,"skillType":"specialty","uses":0,"description":"Strong 4. Your party only needs 4 journey tasks for a Great quality shelter, and your shelter is always at least Good quality."},{"name":"Survival Instincts II","tier":2,"skillType":"specialty","uses":0,"description":"Tenacious 6. Prerequisite: Survival Instincts. When making a journey task roll, points you spend count as double, and you re-roll failures."},{"name":"Grin and Bear it","tier":3,"skillType":"specialty","uses":0,"description":"You gain an additional Mental and Physical Severe wound slot."},{"name":"Pursuit Predator","tier":3,"skillType":"specialty","uses":0,"description":"Agile 5. If you attack an enemy in a lower initiative group than you and you hit, roll an additional die of damage, then add your Survivalist TV to the Stress dealt."},{"name":"Foraged Pharmaceuticals","tier":3,"skillType":"specialty","uses":1,"description":"Vigilant 7, 1/day. By working uninterrupted for 1 hour, you can prepare Medicine 1 from naturally-occurring ingredients."}],"carryCapacity":8},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{},"_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.360","systemId":"cthulhu-dreamt","systemVersion":"0.1.0","createdTime":1781886127854,"modifiedTime":1781886127854,"lastModifiedBy":"system","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}}
{"name":"Navigator","type":"specialty","_id":"91mVkVWArCoXEKQ4","img":"icons/svg/book.svg","system":{"description":"That sense of direction — that internal compass — makes you a guiding light for those who follow you into the unknown.","size":1,"tierMax":3,"attributes":{"strong":{"value":2,"max":2},"agile":{"value":2,"max":2},"cunning":{"value":2,"max":2},"vigilant":{"value":3,"max":3},"careful":{"value":4,"max":4},"tenacious":{"value":2,"max":2}},"physLimit":6,"menLimit":5,"skills":[{"name":"Journeyed Traveler","tier":1,"skillType":"specialty","uses":0,"description":"The Journey Rating of any Journey you're on is decreased by your Navigator TV."},{"name":"Combat Proficiency","tier":1,"skillType":"universal","uses":0,"description":"Gain Proficiency 1 with any weapon category other than EDGe Weapons."},{"name":"Pack Mule","tier":1,"skillType":"specialty","uses":0,"description":"All non-weapon equipment you carry has its size reduced by 1, to a minimum of 1."},{"name":"Perfect Sense of Direction","tier":2,"skillType":"specialty","uses":0,"description":"Vigilant 6. You can never lose your way, and always know how far you've traveled and your approximate location relative to any known landmarks."},{"name":"Lean-To","tier":2,"skillType":"specialty","uses":0,"description":"Careful 6. Your party only needs 4 journey tasks for a Great quality shelter, and your shelter is always at least Good quality."},{"name":"Fleet Feet","tier":2,"skillType":"specialty","uses":0,"description":"Agile 3. You can make the Dodge action as a Minor action a number of times per day equal to your TV."},{"name":"Marching Orders","tier":3,"skillType":"specialty","uses":0,"description":"Cunning 5. Travel time is reduced. Slow Pace takes as long as Normal Pace, and Normal Pace takes as long as Fast Pace."},{"name":"Terrain Master","tier":3,"skillType":"specialty","uses":0,"description":"Vigilant or Careful 7. Points spent on navigating terrain-based obstacles are counted as double. (Choose when taken; may choose a second time for the other option)"},{"name":"Weatherworn","tier":3,"skillType":"specialty","uses":0,"description":"Tenacious 6. Stress you take from terrain-based obstacles is halved."}],"carryCapacity":8},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{},"_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.360","systemId":"cthulhu-dreamt","systemVersion":"0.1.0","createdTime":1781886127854,"modifiedTime":1781886127854,"lastModifiedBy":"system","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}}
{"name":"Scholar","type":"specialty","_id":"C9AGcjwIPQJyvGAg","img":"icons/svg/book.svg","system":{"description":"You have one such mind: a studious, curious mind, filled to the brim with knowledge, ready to apply it to any challenge you face.","size":1,"tierMax":3,"attributes":{"strong":{"value":1,"max":1},"agile":{"value":2,"max":2},"cunning":{"value":4,"max":4},"vigilant":{"value":4,"max":4},"careful":{"value":3,"max":3},"tenacious":{"value":2,"max":2}},"physLimit":4,"menLimit":7,"skills":[{"name":"Subject Matter Expert","tier":1,"skillType":"specialty","uses":0,"description":"Choose a field of study. Any roll involving your field of study has its TN reduced by your Scholar TV."},{"name":"Discipline","tier":1,"skillType":"universal","uses":0,"description":"When you take the Focus action, you add 1 + your Scholar TV to your roll."},{"name":"Quick Study","tier":1,"skillType":"specialty","uses":0,"description":"By studying for only a few minutes, you can learn valuable information about a particular creature or obstacle. Use a number of times per day equal to your TV."},{"name":"Field Research","tier":2,"skillType":"specialty","uses":0,"description":"Vigilant 4. Prerequisite: Quick Study. By studying, you can learn the Physical and Mental Limits of a creature, or all prescribed outcomes of an obstacle. Use a number of times per day equal to your TV."},{"name":"Flow State","tier":2,"skillType":"universal","uses":0,"description":"Agile 5. You may take the Focus action on any Standard Roll a number of times per day equal to your Scholar TV."},{"name":"Sage Advice","tier":2,"skillType":"specialty","uses":1,"description":"Cunning 6, 1/day. As a Minor Action, temporarily increase the Mental Limit of yourself or an ally by half your Mental Limit. Lasts 8 hours."},{"name":"Ecological Expert","tier":3,"skillType":"specialty","uses":1,"description":"Vigilant 5, 1/day. Prerequisite: Field Research. Choose a nearby creature or obstacle. The Facilitator will show you that creature's statblock or all prescribed outcomes."},{"name":"Mindbreak","tier":3,"skillType":"specialty","uses":3,"description":"Cunning 7, 3/day. As a Major Action, inflict 1d6 Mental Stress on a target you can see."},{"name":"Mental Resilience","tier":3,"skillType":"specialty","uses":0,"description":"Tenacious 5. Any time you would take Mental Stress, you only take half as much."}],"carryCapacity":7},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{},"_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.360","systemId":"cthulhu-dreamt","systemVersion":"0.1.0","createdTime":1781886127854,"modifiedTime":1781886127854,"lastModifiedBy":"system","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}}
{"name":"Medic","type":"specialty","_id":"N8mvObPGlWzoDkro","img":"icons/svg/book.svg","system":{"description":"Do no harm. Help where you're able. Your mending touch is what gives you an edge, and your allies are sure to thank you for it.","size":1,"tierMax":3,"attributes":{"strong":{"value":1,"max":1},"agile":{"value":3,"max":3},"cunning":{"value":3,"max":3},"vigilant":{"value":3,"max":3},"careful":{"value":2,"max":2},"tenacious":{"value":4,"max":4}},"physLimit":6,"menLimit":4,"skills":[{"name":"Combat Proficiency","tier":1,"skillType":"universal","uses":0,"description":"You gain Proficiency 1 with small arms and close-quarters weapons, or Proficiency 2 with either."},{"name":"Bedside Manner","tier":1,"skillType":"specialty","uses":0,"description":"When you use Medicine to heal an ally, it is twice as effective."},{"name":"Foraged Pharmaceuticals","tier":1,"skillType":"specialty","uses":1,"description":"1/day. By working uninterrupted for 1 hour, you can prepare Medicine 1 from naturally-occurring ingredients."},{"name":"Foraged Pharmaceuticals II","tier":2,"skillType":"specialty","uses":1,"description":"Vigilant 5, 1/day. Prerequisite: Foraged Pharmaceuticals. By working uninterrupted for 1 hour, you can prepare Medicine 2 from naturally-occurring ingredients."},{"name":"Proper Care","tier":2,"skillType":"specialty","uses":0,"description":"Tenacious 6. All party members' wounds heal twice as fast."},{"name":"Heal","tier":2,"skillType":"specialty","uses":0,"description":"Cunning 5. As a Major action, you can remove one space from the recovery track of a nearby ally's wound (TN: 10 - Medic TV). Also reduce nearby ally's Stress (TN: 6 + stress levels reduced). Once per ally per day."},{"name":"Soothe","tier":3,"skillType":"specialty","uses":0,"description":"Cunning 6. As a Major Action, you may cause a nearby ally to regain a number of points for a given Attribute equal to half their Maximum for that attribute."},{"name":"Fortify","tier":3,"skillType":"specialty","uses":1,"description":"Tenacious 7, 1/day. You can increase the Physical or Mental limit of an ally by a number equal to your Maximum Tenacious. This lasts for 24 hours."},{"name":"Surgical Strike","tier":3,"skillType":"specialty","uses":0,"description":"Agile 7. When you roll a critical success on an attack with a close-quarters weapon, you can add half your Maximum Tenacious to the damage dealt."}],"carryCapacity":6},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{},"_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.360","systemId":"cthulhu-dreamt","systemVersion":"0.1.0","createdTime":1781886127854,"modifiedTime":1781886127854,"lastModifiedBy":"system","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}}
{"name":"Wrecker","type":"specialty","_id":"QRqJJ7MypogzkJmy","img":"icons/svg/book.svg","system":{"description":"There is a certain beauty in the art of destruction. No walls may keep you contained, and no door may keep you out.","size":1,"tierMax":3,"attributes":{"strong":{"value":4,"max":4},"agile":{"value":2,"max":2},"cunning":{"value":2,"max":2},"vigilant":{"value":3,"max":3},"careful":{"value":2,"max":2},"tenacious":{"value":3,"max":3}},"physLimit":7,"menLimit":3,"skills":[{"name":"Combat Proficiency","tier":1,"skillType":"universal","uses":0,"description":"You gain proficiency with close quarters combat weapons and unarmed combat."},{"name":"Demolitions Expert","tier":1,"skillType":"specialty","uses":0,"description":"Any time you deal Stress to an object, double the amount you would normally deal."},{"name":"Clear Threat","tier":1,"skillType":"specialty","uses":0,"description":"As a Major Action, you can draw attention to yourself. All allies other than yourself gain a bonus to rolls against affected creatures equal to your Wrecker TV."},{"name":"Boom","tier":2,"skillType":"specialty","uses":1,"description":"Cunning 4, 1/day. By working uninterrupted for 1 hour, you can prepare 1 Explosive from naturally-occurring ingredients."},{"name":"Physical Resilience","tier":2,"skillType":"specialty","uses":0,"description":"Tenacious 5. Any time you would take Physical Stress, you only take half as much."},{"name":"Brutalize","tier":2,"skillType":"specialty","uses":0,"description":"Strong 6. When making an attack roll, any time you roll an 11 or 12, that roll is a Critical Success, regardless of TN."},{"name":"No Pain, No Gain","tier":3,"skillType":"specialty","uses":0,"description":"Strong 7. After rolling to deal stress, you may take 2 Physical Stress to automatically deal maximum stress."},{"name":"Boom II","tier":3,"skillType":"specialty","uses":1,"description":"Cunning 5, 1/day. Prerequisite: Boom. By working uninterrupted for 1 hour, you can prepare 3 Explosives from naturally-occurring ingredients."},{"name":"Destabilize","tier":3,"skillType":"specialty","uses":0,"description":"Vigilant 6. As a Major Action, hone in on a fracture point. If your next attack hits, the target loses one Action of your choice for one full round."}],"carryCapacity":6},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{},"_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.360","systemId":"cthulhu-dreamt","systemVersion":"0.1.0","createdTime":1781886127854,"modifiedTime":1781886127854,"lastModifiedBy":"system","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}}
{"name":"Occultist","type":"specialty","_id":"X43Sgim17eWcHDwf","img":"icons/svg/book.svg","system":{"description":"The arcane fabric woven between worlds is one you yourself have seen torn and mended. You do not doubt the power of the veil — you seek to understand it... or control it.","size":1,"tierMax":3,"attributes":{"strong":{"value":1,"max":1},"agile":{"value":2,"max":2},"cunning":{"value":4,"max":4},"vigilant":{"value":2,"max":2},"careful":{"value":3,"max":3},"tenacious":{"value":3,"max":3}},"physLimit":3,"menLimit":8,"skills":[{"name":"Eldritch Medium","tier":1,"skillType":"specialty","uses":0,"description":"As a Major Action, you touch a single entity and get a sense for their goals or desires. Use a number of times per day equal to your Occultist TV."},{"name":"Piercing The Veil","tier":1,"skillType":"specialty","uses":0,"description":"As a Minor Action, you can detect if there is a T.R.A.C.E. nearby. You get a sense for its general size and location."},{"name":"Flow State","tier":1,"skillType":"universal","uses":0,"description":"You may take the Focus action on any Standard Roll a number of times per day equal to your Occultist TV."},{"name":"Mental Resilience","tier":2,"skillType":"specialty","uses":0,"description":"Careful 5. Any time you would take Mental Stress from enemies or obstacles, you only take half as much."},{"name":"Mindbreak","tier":2,"skillType":"specialty","uses":0,"description":"Cunning 6. As a Major Action, inflict 1d6 Mental Stress on a target you can see, a number of times per day equal to your TV. After that, you take half as much Mental Stress as you deal."},{"name":"Precognition","tier":2,"skillType":"specialty","uses":0,"description":"Tenacious 5. When a nearby ally fails any roll, you may take 2 Mental Stress to allow them to reroll."},{"name":"Ethereal Cloak","tier":3,"skillType":"specialty","uses":0,"description":"Careful 7. For a number of minutes equal to twice your Tenacious, T.R.A.C.E.s unaware of your presence cannot perceive you and nearby allies."},{"name":"Bend Reality","tier":3,"skillType":"specialty","uses":0,"description":"Cunning 7. As a Minor Action, you can immediately appear in any location within 60 feet. Use a number of times per day equal to your Occultist TV."},{"name":"Mindbreak II","tier":3,"skillType":"specialty","uses":0,"description":"Tenacious 6. Prerequisite: Mindbreak. As a Major Action, inflict 2d6 Mental Stress on a target. After daily uses, you take half as much Mental Stress as you deal."}],"carryCapacity":7},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{},"_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.360","systemId":"cthulhu-dreamt","systemVersion":"0.1.0","createdTime":1781886127854,"modifiedTime":1781886127854,"lastModifiedBy":"system","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}}
{"name":"Experiment","type":"specialty","_id":"ZESDxLmnjyig10xN","img":"icons/svg/book.svg","system":{"description":"You have become the embodiment of unceasing change — voluntarily or not. You are something far different — something more — than what you once were.","size":1,"tierMax":3,"attributes":{"strong":{"value":4,"max":4},"agile":{"value":3,"max":3},"cunning":{"value":2,"max":2},"vigilant":{"value":2,"max":2},"careful":{"value":1,"max":1},"tenacious":{"value":3,"max":3}},"physLimit":7,"menLimit":4,"skills":[{"name":"Unseen","tier":1,"skillType":"universal","uses":0,"description":"Any time you make a roll to stay undetected, add your Experiment TV to that roll."},{"name":"Hyperextension","tier":1,"skillType":"specialty","uses":0,"description":"When you make an attack, you can stretch and dislocate parts of your body in impossible ways. This increases your unarmed attack range from Melee to Close."},{"name":"Calcified Metacarpals","tier":1,"skillType":"specialty","uses":0,"description":"Your unarmed attacks deal 1d6 Physical Stress. You gain Proficiency I with your unarmed attacks."},{"name":"Tank","tier":2,"skillType":"specialty","uses":0,"description":"Strong 6. Strong points spent on a Defend roll are counted as double."},{"name":"Adaptive Mutation","tier":2,"skillType":"specialty","uses":0,"description":"As a Minor Action, you can alter your Physical and Mental Limit values. For every point you increase one Limit, you must decrease the other. Reverts after rest."},{"name":"Composite Exoskeleton","tier":2,"skillType":"specialty","uses":0,"description":"Tenacious 6. Prerequisite: Calcified Metacarpals. Permanent AV equal to your TV. Unarmed attacks deal 2d6 Physical Stress. Once per day, reroll damage die and take higher result."},{"name":"Eldritch Evolution","tier":3,"skillType":"specialty","uses":1,"description":"Any two 6, 1/day. Your body becomes more malleable. Increase your roll against any environmental obstacle by 3."},{"name":"Adrenal Surge","tier":3,"skillType":"specialty","uses":1,"description":"Tenacious 7, 1/day. As a Major Action, you regain a number of points for a given Attribute equal to half your Maximum for that attribute."},{"name":"Alien Physiology","tier":3,"skillType":"specialty","uses":0,"description":"Agile 5. Prerequisite: Composite Exoskeleton. You can make the Attack action as a Minor action 3 times per day. Unarmed attacks deal 3d6 Physical Stress."}],"carryCapacity":7},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{},"_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.360","systemId":"cthulhu-dreamt","systemVersion":"0.1.0","createdTime":1781886127854,"modifiedTime":1781886127854,"lastModifiedBy":"system","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}}
{"name":"Cryptographer","type":"specialty","_id":"byu0fe87MzQV1qRe","img":"icons/svg/book.svg","system":{"description":"Codes, keys, little white lies, and hidden treasures — all of these lie at your fingertips. You now hold the cryptographic keys to the kingdom.","size":1,"tierMax":3,"attributes":{"strong":{"value":2,"max":2},"agile":{"value":1,"max":1},"cunning":{"value":4,"max":4},"vigilant":{"value":4,"max":4},"careful":{"value":3,"max":3},"tenacious":{"value":2,"max":2}},"physLimit":3,"menLimit":7,"skills":[{"name":"Quick Study","tier":1,"skillType":"specialty","uses":0,"description":"By studying a particular creature or obstacle, you're able to glean valuable information about it. You can use this ability a number of times per day equal to your TV."},{"name":"Subtle Cipher","tier":1,"skillType":"specialty","uses":0,"description":"As long as your allies can perceive your messages, you can communicate silently with them."},{"name":"Anticipate and React","tier":1,"skillType":"specialty","uses":0,"description":"Cunning points spent on a Defend roll are counted as double."},{"name":"Basic","tier":2,"skillType":"specialty","uses":0,"description":"Cunning 6. Cunning points spent on interacting with computers or other information technology are counted as double."},{"name":"Combat Proficiency","tier":2,"skillType":"universal","uses":0,"description":"Cunning 6. You gain proficiency 2 with small arms."},{"name":"Unseen","tier":2,"skillType":"universal","uses":0,"description":"Careful 5. Any time you make a roll to stay undetected, add your Cryptographer TV to that roll."},{"name":"Meditative State","tier":3,"skillType":"specialty","uses":1,"description":"Careful 6, 1/day. By meditating uninterrupted for 1 hour, you can reduce your current Mental Stress by half."},{"name":"Epiphany","tier":3,"skillType":"specialty","uses":1,"description":"Vigilant 7, 1/day. By analyzing hidden details, reduce the TN of an obstacle by 3, or the TN of a creature by 2. You can only have 1 epiphany per creature or obstacle."},{"name":"Tetris","tier":3,"skillType":"specialty","uses":0,"description":"Cunning 7. When you pack your equipment for travel, you do so with masterful efficiency. Your carrying capacity is increased by 5."}],"carryCapacity":6},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{},"_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.360","systemId":"cthulhu-dreamt","systemVersion":"0.1.0","createdTime":1781886127854,"modifiedTime":1781886127854,"lastModifiedBy":"system","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}}
{"name":"Communicator","type":"specialty","_id":"cMgToKGKbXpe6nYt","img":"icons/svg/book.svg","system":{"description":"Words are a powerful thing. Your understanding of radio technology and language make you an excellent asset to any team, in any situation.","size":1,"tierMax":3,"attributes":{"strong":{"value":2,"max":2},"agile":{"value":3,"max":3},"cunning":{"value":3,"max":3},"vigilant":{"value":3,"max":3},"careful":{"value":2,"max":2},"tenacious":{"value":2,"max":2}},"physLimit":5,"menLimit":6,"skills":[{"name":"Comms Expert","tier":1,"skillType":"specialty","uses":0,"description":"Any roll involving communications equipment or technology has its TN reduced by your Communicator TV."},{"name":"Positive Feedback","tier":1,"skillType":"specialty","uses":0,"description":"When you Help an ally (or use the 'assist an ally' action in combat) you can spend an additional number of Attribute points equal to your Communicator TV."},{"name":"Active Listening","tier":1,"skillType":"specialty","uses":0,"description":"Cunning points spent on an act of communication or understanding are counted as double."},{"name":"Teamwork","tier":2,"skillType":"specialty","uses":0,"description":"Careful 4. When determining initiative, you can change the initiative group of a number of allies equal to your current Tenacious."},{"name":"Subtle Cipher","tier":2,"skillType":"specialty","uses":0,"description":"Cunning 6. As long as your allies can perceive your messages, you can communicate with them undetected."},{"name":"Combat Proficiency","tier":2,"skillType":"universal","uses":0,"description":"You gain Proficiency 1 with close-quarters weapons and long arms, or Proficiency 2 with either."},{"name":"Sonar","tier":3,"skillType":"specialty","uses":0,"description":"Vigilant 6. Your hearing is so refined that you know the exact location of any invisible or hidden creature within 30 feet of you."},{"name":"Cognitive Dissonance","tier":3,"skillType":"specialty","uses":0,"description":"Cunning 7. When you deal Mental Stress to a target, increase the Stress dealt by 3."},{"name":"Mockingbird","tier":3,"skillType":"specialty","uses":3,"description":"Tenacious 6, 3/day. As a Major Action, you can imitate a sound that distracts, taunts, or unnerves a target. Immediately deal Mental Stress equal to your maximum Tenacious and lower the TN of the target by 3."}],"carryCapacity":7},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{},"_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.360","systemId":"cthulhu-dreamt","systemVersion":"0.1.0","createdTime":1781886127854,"modifiedTime":1781886127854,"lastModifiedBy":"system","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}}
{"name":"Skeptic","type":"specialty","_id":"cab9hnngEdlVGqQa","img":"icons/svg/book.svg","system":{"description":"You read between the lines. You trust only what you know to be real, always seeking the purest distillation of the truth. Your insight serves you well.","size":1,"tierMax":3,"attributes":{"strong":{"value":2,"max":2},"agile":{"value":2,"max":2},"cunning":{"value":2,"max":2},"vigilant":{"value":4,"max":4},"careful":{"value":4,"max":4},"tenacious":{"value":2,"max":2}},"physLimit":4,"menLimit":6,"skills":[{"name":"Question Everything","tier":1,"skillType":"specialty","uses":0,"description":"Your skeptical mind makes you more difficult to deceive. Whenever you roll to see through a deception or an illusion, add your Skeptic TV to the roll."},{"name":"Gumshoe","tier":1,"skillType":"specialty","uses":0,"description":"Vigilant points spent to analyze a creature or a scene count as double."},{"name":"Combat Proficiency","tier":1,"skillType":"universal","uses":0,"description":"You gain proficiency 2 with small arms."},{"name":"Unseen","tier":2,"skillType":"universal","uses":0,"description":"Careful 6. Any time you make a roll to stay undetected, add your Skeptic TV to that roll."},{"name":"Attention to Detail","tier":2,"skillType":"specialty","uses":0,"description":"Vigilant 6. As a Minor Action, you can study your surroundings and glean hidden information. Use a number of times per day equal to your TV."},{"name":"Evasive","tier":2,"skillType":"universal","uses":0,"description":"Agile 4. Agile points spent on a Defend roll are counted as double."},{"name":"Red Thread","tier":3,"skillType":"specialty","uses":1,"description":"Careful 7, 1/day. As a Major Action, choose one: Reduce TN of all nearby creatures by 1, reduce TN of all nearby obstacles by 1, or reduce your current Journey Modifier by 1. Lasts 24 hours."},{"name":"Look Alive","tier":3,"skillType":"specialty","uses":0,"description":"Vigilant 7. When you would take any stress, you can reduce the amount of stress taken by 1 for each point of AP you spend."},{"name":"Mind Games","tier":3,"skillType":"specialty","uses":3,"description":"Cunning 5, 3/day. As a Major Action, for one minute, a creature that can hear you becomes hostile to its allies and neutral towards you."}],"carryCapacity":6},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{},"_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.360","systemId":"cthulhu-dreamt","systemVersion":"0.1.0","createdTime":1781886127854,"modifiedTime":1781886127854,"lastModifiedBy":"system","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}}
{"name":"Mercenary","type":"specialty","_id":"fZH9uv7PDkXmytum","img":"icons/svg/book.svg","system":{"description":"You represent bravery, strength, and a willingness to do what needs to be done — no matter the costs or consequences.","size":1,"tierMax":3,"attributes":{"strong":{"value":3,"max":3},"agile":{"value":2,"max":2},"cunning":{"value":1,"max":1},"vigilant":{"value":3,"max":3},"careful":{"value":3,"max":3},"tenacious":{"value":2,"max":2}},"physLimit":7,"menLimit":5,"skills":[{"name":"Combat Proficiency","tier":1,"skillType":"universal","uses":0,"description":"Gain Proficiency 2 with any two weapon categories other than EDGe Weapons."},{"name":"Discipline","tier":1,"skillType":"universal","uses":0,"description":"When you take the Focus action, you instead add 1 + your Mercenary TV to your roll."},{"name":"Bear Arms","tier":1,"skillType":"specialty","uses":0,"description":"All weapons you carry have their size reduced by your Mercenary TV (minimum 1). Ammunition does not count against your carrying capacity."},{"name":"Pinpoint Accuracy","tier":2,"skillType":"specialty","uses":0,"description":"Vigilant 5. If your attack roll exceeds an opponent's TN by 3 or more, you deal additional stress equal to your Mercenary TV."},{"name":"Instinct","tier":2,"skillType":"specialty","uses":0,"description":"Careful 6. You may choose which Initiative Group you act in."},{"name":"Brutalize","tier":2,"skillType":"specialty","uses":0,"description":"Strong 6. When making an attack roll, any time you roll an 11 or 12, that roll is a Critical Success, regardless of TN."},{"name":"Vicious Attack","tier":3,"skillType":"specialty","uses":0,"description":"Agile 5. You can make the Attack action as a Minor action a number of times per day equal to your Mercenary TV."},{"name":"Grit Your Teeth","tier":3,"skillType":"specialty","uses":1,"description":"Tenacious 5, 1/day. You can ignore the effects of a wound for a number of hours equal to your Max Tenacious. Only one wound can be affected."},{"name":"Squad Tactics","tier":3,"skillType":"specialty","uses":0,"description":"Cunning 4. As a Minor Action, any allied creature that can hear you may take a Major Action of their choice. Use a number of times per day equal to your Mercenary TV."}],"carryCapacity":8},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{},"_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.360","systemId":"cthulhu-dreamt","systemVersion":"0.1.0","createdTime":1781886127854,"modifiedTime":1781886127854,"lastModifiedBy":"system","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}}
{"name":"Engineer","type":"specialty","_id":"hyAfmqrmtMcD1MFq","img":"icons/svg/book.svg","system":{"description":"Realistically, everything in this world can be broken down to simple machines. You have the know-how to combine these things and build something truly impressive.","size":1,"tierMax":3,"attributes":{"strong":{"value":2,"max":2},"agile":{"value":1,"max":1},"cunning":{"value":4,"max":4},"vigilant":{"value":2,"max":2},"careful":{"value":3,"max":3},"tenacious":{"value":2,"max":2}},"physLimit":5,"menLimit":7,"skills":[{"name":"Popular Mechanics","tier":1,"skillType":"specialty","uses":0,"description":"When making a roll to interact with any kind of machinery, reduce the TN of the roll by your Engineer TV."},{"name":"Custom Modifications I","tier":1,"skillType":"specialty","uses":1,"description":"1/day. By working uninterrupted for 1 hour, you can improve a weapon's capabilities. Whenever that weapon deals Stress, add your Engineer TV to the amount of Stress dealt."},{"name":"Combat Proficiency","tier":1,"skillType":"universal","uses":0,"description":"You gain proficiency 1 with small and long arms or you gain proficiency 2 with either."},{"name":"Junkrat","tier":2,"skillType":"specialty","uses":1,"description":"Careful 6, 1/day. By disassembling a piece of equipment for 1 hour, you can create a number of pieces of Junk equal to the Size of the disassembled machine (Maximum 5)."},{"name":"Breaking and Entering","tier":2,"skillType":"specialty","uses":0,"description":"Cunning 6. Cunning points spent on bypassing a mechanical obstacle are counted as double. Additionally, you leave little to no trace of your tampering."},{"name":"Custom Modifications II","tier":2,"skillType":"specialty","uses":1,"description":"Tenacious 4, 1/day. Prerequisite: Custom Modifications. Weapon deals +Engineer TV Stress. When attacking with a modified weapon, you may reroll the damage once."},{"name":"Lean-To","tier":3,"skillType":"specialty","uses":0,"description":"Strong 7. Your party only needs 4 journey tasks for a Great quality shelter, and your shelter is always at least Good quality."},{"name":"Boom","tier":3,"skillType":"specialty","uses":1,"description":"Careful 5, 1/day. By working uninterrupted for 1 hour, you can prepare 1 Explosive from naturally-occurring ingredients."},{"name":"Custom Modifications III","tier":3,"skillType":"specialty","uses":1,"description":"Tenacious 5, 1/day. Prerequisite: Custom Modifications II. Weapon deals +3 Stress plus an extra damage die. May reroll damage, using either result."}],"carryCapacity":8},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{},"_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.360","systemId":"cthulhu-dreamt","systemVersion":"0.1.0","createdTime":1781886127854,"modifiedTime":1781886127854,"lastModifiedBy":"system","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}}
{"name":"Hunter","type":"specialty","_id":"xq875FIU7Jrm4k1F","img":"icons/svg/book.svg","system":{"description":"Your heightened senses are what make you who you are. A keen eye, a powerful sense of smell, and a deep understanding of your target — your prey.","size":1,"tierMax":3,"attributes":{"strong":{"value":2,"max":2},"agile":{"value":2,"max":2},"cunning":{"value":3,"max":3},"vigilant":{"value":4,"max":4},"careful":{"value":2,"max":2},"tenacious":{"value":1,"max":1}},"physLimit":6,"menLimit":6,"skills":[{"name":"Combat Proficiency","tier":1,"skillType":"universal","uses":0,"description":"Gain Proficiency 1 with any weapon category."},{"name":"Unseen","tier":1,"skillType":"universal","uses":0,"description":"Any time you make a roll to stay undetected, add your Hunter TV to that roll."},{"name":"Keen Eye","tier":1,"skillType":"specialty","uses":0,"description":"Any Vigilant points spent to identify, track, or locate any creature count as double."},{"name":"Instinct","tier":2,"skillType":"specialty","uses":0,"description":"Cunning 5. You may choose which Initiative Group you act in."},{"name":"Pinpoint Accuracy","tier":2,"skillType":"specialty","uses":0,"description":"Vigilant 6. If your attack roll exceeds an opponent's TN by 3 or more, you deal additional stress equal to your Hunter TV."},{"name":"Ambush Predator","tier":2,"skillType":"specialty","uses":0,"description":"Agile 5. If you attack an enemy in a higher initiative group than you and you hit, roll an additional die of damage, then add your Hunter TV to the Stress dealt."},{"name":"Frenzy","tier":3,"skillType":"specialty","uses":0,"description":"Agile 6. Any time you would deal Physical Stress, you may spend Agile points to deal equal additional Physical Stress. Agile points spent this way count as double."},{"name":"Critical Shot","tier":3,"skillType":"specialty","uses":1,"description":"Cunning 6, 1/day. As a Minor action, you make your next attack against a target an automatic Critical Success."},{"name":"Marksman's Eye","tier":3,"skillType":"specialty","uses":0,"description":"Vigilant 7. Any time you roll a 1 on a damage die, you may re-roll that die."}],"carryCapacity":8},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{},"_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.360","systemId":"cthulhu-dreamt","systemVersion":"0.1.0","createdTime":1781886127854,"modifiedTime":1781886127854,"lastModifiedBy":"system","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}}
{"name":"Athlete","type":"specialty","_id":"zEyIyZFPwYD4VpCj","img":"icons/svg/book.svg","system":{"description":"Your body is your greatest weapon. You've pushed it to its limits and beyond, honing it into a finely-tuned machine capable of feats most only dream of.","size":1,"tierMax":3,"attributes":{"strong":{"value":3,"max":3},"agile":{"value":4,"max":4},"cunning":{"value":1,"max":1},"vigilant":{"value":2,"max":2},"careful":{"value":2,"max":2},"tenacious":{"value":3,"max":3}},"physLimit":7,"menLimit":5,"skills":[{"name":"Second Wind","tier":1,"skillType":"specialty","uses":1,"description":"As a Major Action, you regain a number of Strong or Agile points equal to half your Maximum for that attribute."},{"name":"Adrenaline Rush","tier":1,"skillType":"specialty","uses":0,"description":"Strong or Agile points spent on a feat of athleticism are counted as double. (Choose one Attribute when you take this ability. You may choose this Skill a second time, but you must choose the option you did not choose previously)"},{"name":"Combat Proficiency","tier":1,"skillType":"universal","uses":0,"description":"You gain Proficiency 1 with close quarters combat weapons and unarmed combat, or you gain Proficiency 2 with either."},{"name":"Cool Down Stretches","tier":2,"skillType":"specialty","uses":1,"description":"Careful 4, 1/day. By stretching your muscles and resting for 1 hour, you can reduce your current Physical Stress by half your Max Tenacious value."},{"name":"Sprint","tier":2,"skillType":"universal","uses":0,"description":"Agile 6. You may take the Run action as a minor action."},{"name":"Pushing the Limit I","tier":2,"skillType":"specialty","uses":0,"description":"Tenacious 5. Increase the number of AP you can spend before you overexert yourself by 1."},{"name":"Look Alive","tier":3,"skillType":"specialty","uses":0,"description":"Vigilant 5. When you would take any stress, you can reduce the amount of stress taken by 1 for each point of AP you spend."},{"name":"Maximum Impact","tier":3,"skillType":"specialty","uses":0,"description":"Strong or Agile 7. Any time you would deal Physical Stress with a Melee attack, you may spend a number of Strong or Agile points to deal an equal amount of additional Physical Stress."},{"name":"Pushing the Limit II","tier":3,"skillType":"specialty","uses":0,"description":"Tenacious 6. Prerequisite: Pushing The Limit. Increase the number of AP you can spend before you overexert yourself by 3."}],"carryCapacity":7},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{},"_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.360","systemId":"cthulhu-dreamt","systemVersion":"0.1.0","createdTime":1781886127854,"modifiedTime":1781886127854,"lastModifiedBy":"system","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}}
